{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20781","headline":"忆金鹅山沈山人二首 二 · 卢仝","name":"忆金鹅山沈山人二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君爱链药药欲成，我爱链骨骨已清。\n试自比校得仙者，也应合得天上行。\n天门九重高崔嵬，清空凿出黄金堆。\n夜叉守门昼不啓，夜半醮祭夜半开。\n夜叉喜欢动关锁，锁声㩧地生风雷。\n地上禽兽重血食，性命血化飞黄埃。\n太上道君莲花台，九门隔阔安在哉？\n呜呼！沈君大药成，兼须巧会鬼物情，无求长生丧厥生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}